{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "借来的投票",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 106.84,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "规则被组合利用，不只发生在借贷里。",
   "spoken": "规则被组合利用，不只发生在借贷里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 1.701,
   "speechEnd": 4.89
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "治理攻击，是攻击者拿到足够的投票权，通过恶意提案，合法地转走协议资产。",
   "spoken": "治理攻击，是攻击者拿到足够的投票权，通过恶意提案，合法的转走协议资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 5.26,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 5.26,
   "speechEnd": 12.956
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "2022 年 4 月，以太坊上的 Beanstalk。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 4 月，以太坊上的 Beanstalk。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 13.32,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 13.424,
   "speechEnd": 16.609
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "它的投票权，按当前的存款计算。",
   "spoken": "它的投票权，按当前的存款计算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 16.98,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 16.98,
   "speechEnd": 19.552
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "它另有一条紧急通道。",
   "spoken": "它另有一条紧急通道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 20.0,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 20.0,
   "speechEnd": 21.913
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "按 CertiK 的分析，提案满 1 天，拿到三分之二的票，就能立刻执行。",
   "spoken": "按 CertiK 的分析，提案满 1 天，拿到三分之二的票，就能立刻执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 22.3,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 22.395,
   "speechEnd": 27.103
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 27.56,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 27.56,
   "speechEnd": 28.368
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "闪电贷必须在同一笔交易里归还。用借来的代币，能通过提案吗？",
   "spoken": "闪电贷必须在同一笔交易里归环。用借来的代币，能通过提案吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 28.82,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 28.82,
   "speechEnd": 33.914
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "能。借款，存入，投票，执行，还款，全在同一笔交易里。",
   "spoken": "能。借款，存入，投票，执行，环款，全在同一笔交易里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 34.6,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 34.6,
   "speechEnd": 40.534
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "闪电贷的归还限制，一步也没有挡住。",
   "spoken": "闪电贷的归环限制，一步也没有挡住。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 40.98,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 40.98,
   "speechEnd": 43.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "攻击者提前一天，就提交了提案。",
   "spoken": "攻击者提前一天，就提交了提案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 44.32,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 44.412,
   "speechEnd": 46.728
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "获利口径各方不同。CertiK 称约 7600 万美元，Beanstalk 称约 7700 万美元，PeckShield 估约 8000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "获利口径各方不同。CertiK 称约 7600 万美元，Beanstalk 称约 7700 万美元，PeckShield 估约 8000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 47.18,
   "dur": 9.6,
   "speechStart": 47.18,
   "speechEnd": 56.604
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "修复有两步。",
   "spoken": "修复有两步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 57.0,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 57.0,
   "speechEnd": 58.114
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "投票权用提案创建之前那个区块的快照。借来的代币，那时并不在你手里。",
   "spoken": "投票权用提案创建之前那个区块的快照。借来的代币，那时并不在你手里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 58.58,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 58.675,
   "speechEnd": 64.965
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "提案通过以后，先过时间锁，再执行。中间留出守护者否决的机会。",
   "spoken": "提案通过以后，先过时间锁，再执行。中间留出守护者否决的机会。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 65.36,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 65.36,
   "speechEnd": 71.07
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "再加上法定人数，并锁定提案内容。内容一改，重新计时。",
   "spoken": "再加上法定人数，并锁定提案内容。内容一改，虫新计时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 71.5,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 71.5,
   "speechEnd": 77.121
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "奖励分发，也有同样的问题。",
   "spoken": "奖励分发，也有同样的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 77.56,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 77.653,
   "speechEnd": 79.673
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "如果奖励按存入那一刻的余额计算，就能用闪电贷存入，领奖，取出。",
   "spoken": "如果奖励按存入那一刻的余额计算，就能用闪电贷存入，领奖，取出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 80.1,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 80.193,
   "speechEnd": 86.138
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "修复是让奖励随时间累积，存入以后有最短锁定期。",
   "spoken": "修复是让奖励随时间累积，存入以后有最短锁定期。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 86.56,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 86.651,
   "speechEnd": 91.793
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "奖励的计算，不能读一笔交易里就能改变的数据，比如本区块的成交量，或者池子的价格。",
   "spoken": "奖励的计算，不能读一笔交易里就能改变的数据，比如本区块的成交量，或者池子的价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 92.22,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 92.22,
   "speechEnd": 99.448
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "这几件事有个共同点。攻击者借来的，是规模。利用的，是时间。",
   "spoken": "这几件事有个共同点。攻击者借来的，是规模。利用的，是时间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 99.88,
